  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "🚀 Enhancements\n      **Improved Word Section Management**\n      Enhanced handling of sectPr in WordprocessingML, including precise mapping of:\n      - Page size and orientation\n      - Margins and gutters\n      - Page borders\n      - Columns\n      - Document grid\n      This update significantly improves document layout fidelity when loading or generating DOCX files.\n      \n    🛠️ Bug Fixes\n      **DOM → HTML Conversion Improvements**\n      - Fixed margin, spacing, and padding inconsistencies\n      - Corrected color, shading, and border translation\n      - Improved text normalization, span merging, and inline formatting\n      - Refined CSS output for consistent styling\n      - More accurate conversion of font settings (size, bold, italic, underline, color)",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "VDocs - Word Document Framework",
  "verbatimVersion": "2025.11.3",
